---
permalink: /contact/
title: Contact Us | Gary Germer & Associates
description: "We are here to answer any questions you may have about our store and our services. Visit our Portland gallery, call, email, or request a consultation below."
ogTitle: Contact Us | Gary Germer & Associates
ogDescription: "Drop us a line or visit our Portland gallery. See our hours, address, and how to reach us — or request a consultation."
ogImage: /assets/images/art/contact-hero-mantel.jpg
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block head %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ProfessionalService",
  "name": "Gary Germer & Associates",
  "url": "https://www.garygermer.com/contact/",
  "image": "https://www.garygermer.com/assets/images/art/contact-hero-mantel.jpg",
  "telephone": "+1-503-235-0946",
  "email": "info@garygermer.com",
  "priceRange": "$$",
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": "407 N. Broadway St.",
    "addressLocality": "Portland",
    "addressRegion": "OR",
    "postalCode": "97227",
    "addressCountry": "US"
  },
  "openingHoursSpecification": [
    {
      "@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification",
      "dayOfWeek": ["Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday"],
      "opens": "10:00",
      "closes": "17:00"
    }
  ],
  "aggregateRating": {
    "@type": "AggregateRating",
    "ratingValue": "4.7",
    "reviewCount": "100"
  }
}
</script>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

  <!-- ============================== HERO ==============================
       The hero carries the headline and the consultation form, nothing
       else. The address, hours, phone and email used to be stacked here as
       white italic text over the busiest photograph on the site, competing
       with the form beside them; they now live in the legible Visit band
       below, which leaves the copy column at four short elements. -->
  <section class="hero sale-hero sale-hero--tall" id="contact-hero">
    <div class="hero-media">
      {% art "contact-hero-mantel", "100vw", "", "eager" %}
    </div>
    <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="hero-shell sale-hero-shell">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-dark">At Your Service</p>
        <h1 class="hero-heading">Drop a Line or Visit Us</h1>
        <span class="hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="hero-lead hero-lead-compact">We are here to answer any questions you may have about our store and our services. Feel free to contact us by any method below. If you&rsquo;re looking for information about a specific object, please use this contact form and provide as much detail as possible.</p>
        <p class="hero-proof"><strong>4.7 Stars on Google Reviews.</strong> Serving Portland and the Pacific Northwest.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Anchor kept at #consultation so existing links to
           /contact/#consultation still land on the form. -->
      <div class="hero-form-card sale-info-bar" id="consultation">
        <h2>Request a Consultation</h2>
        <form class="form-grid" action="/api/submit-inquiry" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" novalidate>
          <input type="hidden" name="form" value="contact">
          <div class="form-honey" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="contact-page-company">Leave this field empty</label>
            <input type="text" id="contact-page-company" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="contact-page-name">Name</label>
              <input id="contact-page-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
              <p class="field-error" role="alert">Please enter your name.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="contact-page-email">Email</label>
              <input id="contact-page-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
              <p class="field-error" role="alert">Please enter a valid email.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="contact-page-phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="contact-page-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label class="field-label" for="contact-page-need">I need help with&hellip;</label>
              <select id="contact-page-need" name="I need help with" required>
                <option value="" selected disabled>Select One&hellip;</option>
                <option>An appraisal</option>
                <option>An estate</option>
                <option>Consignment</option>
                <option>Something else</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label" for="contact-page-message">Tell us a little about the estate, object, or collection (optional)</label>
            <textarea id="contact-page-message" name="message" rows="3"></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label class="field-label" for="contact-page-photos">Add photos (optional)</label>
            <div class="field-file">
              <input id="contact-page-photos" name="attachment" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple>
              <p class="form-note">JPG, PNG, or WEBP. Up to 4MB total (large photos are shrunk automatically).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="form-submit-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <button class="button button-navy" type="submit">Request a Consultation</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================== VISIT ==============================
       Map beside the hours block. The map is a keyless Google Maps embed
       (output=embed), lazy-loaded so it costs nothing above the fold. -->
  <section class="section visit-band" id="visit" aria-labelledby="visit-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="visit-grid">
        <div class="visit-map">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=407+N.+Broadway+St.,+Portland,+OR+97227&output=embed"
            title="Map showing Gary Germer &amp; Associates at 407 N. Broadway St., Portland, OR 97227"
            width="600" height="450"
            loading="lazy"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
        </div>

        <div class="visit-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-navy">Our Gallery</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading" id="visit-heading">Visit Us in Portland</h2>

          <dl class="visit-details">
            <div class="visit-detail">
              <dt>Address</dt>
              <dd>
                Gary Germer &amp; Associates<br>
                407 N. Broadway St.<br>
                Portland, OR 97227
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="visit-detail">
              <dt>Hours</dt>
              <dd>
                10:00am&ndash;5:00pm<br>
                Tuesday through Saturday,<br>
                or by appointment.
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="visit-detail">
              <dt>Phone</dt>
              <dd><a class="visit-link" href="tel:+15032350946">(503) 235-0946</a></dd>
            </div>
            <div class="visit-detail">
              <dt>Email</dt>
              <dd><a class="visit-link" href="mailto:info@garygermer.com">info@garygermer.com</a></dd>
            </div>
          </dl>

          <p class="visit-note">As we occasionally close our storefront for off-site events and sales, please call ahead to confirm we&rsquo;re open before your visit.</p>

          <div class="visit-ctas">
            <a class="button button-navy" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=407+N.+Broadway+St.+Portland+OR+97227" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions</a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="tel:+15032350946">Call Before You Go</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================== PROOF ==============================
       Short-form social proof between the contact details and the ask.
       Quotes are the same verified reviews carried on the homepage. -->
  <section class="section on-dark contact-proof" aria-labelledby="contact-proof-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stack-header text-center mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-heading mx-auto" id="contact-proof-heading">More Than 10,000 Families Have Trusted Us</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-proof-grid">
        <div class="testimonial">
          <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
          <p class="testimonial-quote">I had the pleasure of working with Gary Germer &amp; Associates for an appraisal and was thoroughly impressed with the level of professionalism and expertise. Not only was the appraisal evaluation quick and accurate, but it was presented in a clear and comprehensive manner, making it easy for me to understand the value.</p>
          <p class="testimonial-attribution">&mdash; Austin H., Appraisal Client</p>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial">
          <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
          <p class="testimonial-quote">We go to lots of estate sales and Gary Germer&rsquo;s sales are always heads above the rest. Gary has a real respect and almost reverence for people&rsquo;s belongings. Everything is so beautifully displayed. We always leave his sales laughing and with something unique for our home.</p>
          <p class="testimonial-attribution">&mdash; Brad Thomas, Estate Sale Client</p>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial">
          <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
          <p class="testimonial-quote">Gary and his team were professional, highly responsive, and navigated a complex situation with care and expertise. The estate sale itself was well-organized, well-staffed, and ran smoothly. I would not hesitate to recommend Gary Germer &amp; Associates to anyone navigating an estate sale.</p>
          <p class="testimonial-attribution">&mdash; M.R. | Estate Sale Client</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-proof-badges">
        <div class="google-badge">
          <span class="google-badge-label">Google Reviews</span>
          <img class="testimonial-proof-badge" src="/assets/images/google-reviews-badge.png" width="556" height="118" loading="lazy" alt="Rating: 4.7 stars from 123 reviews">
        </div>
        <div class="contact-proof-seals">
          <img class="hero-trust-seal" src="/assets/images/logos/badge-licensed-bonded-insured-white.png" width="162" height="161" loading="lazy" alt="Licensed, Bonded, Insured">
          <img src="/assets/images/logos/badge-uspap-white.png" width="299" height="105" loading="lazy" alt="USPAP — Uniform Standards of Professional Appraisal Practice">
          <img src="/assets/images/logos/badge-irs-compliant-white.png" width="423" height="77" loading="lazy" alt="IRS Compliant">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================ DISCOVERY ============================ -->
  {% set signupSubject = "Contact page" %}
  {% include "partials/discovery-band.njk" %}

{% endblock %}
